{"id":"7e3f8bc11ea2869a","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/632_带过去算子的_LTL.md","title":"632 带过去算子的 LTL","display":"632_带过去算子的_LTL","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{632}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}:=\\mathsf{Prop}_{632}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prop}_{632}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}:=\\mathsf{Prop}_{632}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>后一个等号只是本文件的显示缩写。原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{next},\\operatorname{prev},\\operatorname{until},\\operatorname{since}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{next},\\operatorname{prev},\\operatorname{until},\\operatorname{since}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)=\\neg A\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)=\\neg A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)=A\\to B\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)=A\\to B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{next}(A)=XA\">\\(\\operatorname{next}(A)=XA\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{prev}(A)=YA\">\\(\\operatorname{prev}(A)=YA\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{until}(A,B)=A\\,U\\,B\">\\(\\operatorname{until}(A,B)=A\\,U\\,B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{since}(A,B)=A\\,S\\,B\">\\(\\operatorname{since}(A,B)=A\\,S\\,B\\)</span>。这些等号约定构造树的显示，不增加等式公理。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"XA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\">\\(XA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"YA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\">\\(YA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\,U\\,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\">\\(A\\,U\\,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\,S\\,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\">\\(A\\,S\\,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"2.1-派生记号\">2.1 派生记号</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\)</span>，以下都是展开到原始构造树的缩写：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top:=\\neg\\bot,\\qquad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\qquad\nA\\lor B:=(\\neg A\\to B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top:=\\neg\\bot,\\qquad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\qquad\nA\\lor B:=(\\neg A\\to B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FA:=\\top\\,U\\,A,\\qquad\nPA:=\\top\\,S\\,A,\\qquad\nGA:=\\neg F\\neg A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FA:=\\top\\,U\\,A,\\qquad\nPA:=\\top\\,S\\,A,\\qquad\nGA:=\\neg F\\neg A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>右端按照上述从前到后的定义展开；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{632}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{632}\\)</span>、替换、公理成员和满足关系均作用于展开后的唯一原始构造树。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元\">3. 自由变元</h1>\n<p>定义两个类型化函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{632},\\operatorname{BV}_{632}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\longrightarrow\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{632}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{632},\\operatorname{BV}_{632}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\longrightarrow\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{632}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(XA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(YA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(XA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(YA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(A\\,U\\,B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(A\\,U\\,B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(A\\,S\\,B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(A\\,S\\,B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{632}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{632}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{632}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>；这是因为八个原始构造子均不绑定命题变元。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{632}\">\\(\\mathsf{Subst}_{632}\\)</span> 为所有有限支撑函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\)</span> 的集合，其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}_{632}(\\sigma)\n=\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{supp}_{632}(\\sigma)\n=\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>是有限集。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{632}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{632}\\)</span> 唯一扩张为函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{632}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{632}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(B),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(XA)=X\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(A),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(YA)=Y\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(B),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(XA)=X\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(A),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(YA)=Y\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(A\\,U\\,B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(A)\\,U\\,\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(B),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(A\\,S\\,B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(A)\\,S\\,\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(A\\,U\\,B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(A)\\,U\\,\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(B),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(A\\,S\\,B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(A)\\,S\\,\\widehat\\sigma_{632}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,632}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,632}B\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理三族与时态公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{XK}^{632}=\\{X(A\\to B)\\to(XA\\to XB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{XK}^{632}=\\{X(A\\to B)\\to(XA\\to XB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{YK}^{632}=\\{Y(A\\to B)\\to(YA\\to YB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{YK}^{632}=\\{Y(A\\to B)\\to(YA\\to YB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{UFix}^{632}=\\{(A\\,U\\,B)\\leftrightarrow(B\\lor(A\\land X(A\\,U\\,B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{UFix}^{632}=\\{(A\\,U\\,B)\\leftrightarrow(B\\lor(A\\land X(A\\,U\\,B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SFix}^{632}=\\{(A\\,S\\,B)\\leftrightarrow(B\\lor(A\\land Y(A\\,S\\,B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{SFix}^{632}=\\{(A\\,S\\,B)\\leftrightarrow(B\\lor(A\\land Y(A\\,S\\,B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{632}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{632}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{632}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{632}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{632}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{632}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{632}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{632}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{632}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{632}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{XK}^{632}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{YK}^{632}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{UFix}^{632}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SFix}^{632}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{632}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{632}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{632}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{632}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{XK}^{632}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{YK}^{632}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{UFix}^{632}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SFix}^{632}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则关系\">6. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{632}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{632}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{632}=\\{((A),XA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{632}=\\{((A),XA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecY}^{632}=\\{((A),YA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecY}^{632}=\\{((A),YA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{632}\n=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{632}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{632}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecY}^{632}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{632}\n=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{632}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{632}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecY}^{632}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这里不注册从单个后固定点前提推出强 until/since 的规则：在双向无限迹上，该前提不能排除无穷延期，因而不足以推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的有限见证。于是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{632}\\subseteq\n\\left(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}^{\\,n}\\right)\n\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{632}\\subseteq\n\\left(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}^{\\,n}\\right)\n\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>定义证明行载体与证明对象函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Line}_{632}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{632})\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{632},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Line}_{632}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{632})\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{632},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{632}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{632})\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal P\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{m&gt;0}\\mathsf{Line}_{632}^{\\,m}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Proof}_{632}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{632})\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal P\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{m&gt;0}\\mathsf{Line}_{632}^{\\,m}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Line}_{632}^{\\,m}\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Line}_{632}^{\\,m}\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LineOK}_{632}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\land\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\})\\\\\n{}\\lor{}&amp;(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{632}\\land\\Delta_i=\\varnothing)\\\\\n{}\\lor{}&amp;\\exists j,k&lt;i\\,\n(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{632}\n\\land\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k)\\\\\n{}\\lor{}&amp;\\exists j&lt;i\\,\n(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{632}\n\\land\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing)\\\\\n{}\\lor{}&amp;\\exists j&lt;i\\,\n(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecY}^{632}\n\\land\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LineOK}_{632}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\land\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\})\\\\\n{}\\lor{}&amp;(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{632}\\land\\Delta_i=\\varnothing)\\\\\n{}\\lor{}&amp;\\exists j,k&lt;i\\,\n(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{632}\n\\land\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k)\\\\\n{}\\lor{}&amp;\\exists j&lt;i\\,\n(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{632}\n\\land\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing)\\\\\n{}\\lor{}&amp;\\exists j&lt;i\\,\n(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecY}^{632}\n\\land\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其类型域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{(\\Gamma,\\pi,i):\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{632},\\ m&gt;0,\\ \\pi\\in\\mathsf{Line}_{632}^{\\,m},\\ i&lt;m\\}\">\\(\\{(\\Gamma,\\pi,i):\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{632},\\ m&gt;0,\\ \\pi\\in\\mathsf{Line}_{632}^{\\,m},\\ i&lt;m\\}\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{632}(\\Gamma)\n=\\bigcup_{m&gt;0}\\{\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Line}_{632}^{\\,m}:\n\\forall i&lt;m\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{632}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Proof}_{632}(\\Gamma)\n=\\bigcup_{m&gt;0}\\{\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Line}_{632}^{\\,m}:\n\\forall i&lt;m\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{632}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>行与序列使用逐分量字面相等；支撑集合使用集合相等。五种行许可是析取：至少一种成立即可，不要求多种同时成立。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{632}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{632}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists m&gt;0\\ \\exists\\pi=((\\Delta_j,A_j))_{j&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{632}(\\Gamma)\\,\n\\exists i&lt;m\\ (A_i=A\\land\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists m&gt;0\\ \\exists\\pi=((\\Delta_j,A_j))_{j&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{632}(\\Gamma)\\,\n\\exists i&lt;m\\ (A_i=A\\land\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{632}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{632}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{632}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{632}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本系统在 LTL 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,U\">\\(X,U\\)</span> 基础上加入过去算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y,S\">\\(Y,S\\)</span>，并对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,S\">\\(U,S\\)</span> 给出展开固定点公理；强 until/since 的有限见证由语义直接刻画，不以不可靠的后固定点归纳规则代替。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-双向线性时间结构\">10. 双向线性时间结构</h1>\n<p>定义双向迹集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Trace}_{632}\n=\n\\{\\nu:\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Trace}_{632}\n=\n\\{\\nu:\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义后继、前驱与线性可达关系：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Succ}_{632}(i,j)\\Longleftrightarrow j=i+1,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Pred}_{632}(i,j)\\Longleftrightarrow j=i-1,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Succ}_{632}(i,j)\\Longleftrightarrow j=i+1,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Pred}_{632}(i,j)\\Longleftrightarrow j=i-1,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FReach}_{632}(i,j)\\Longleftrightarrow i\\le j,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{PReach}_{632}(i,j)\\Longleftrightarrow j\\le i.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FReach}_{632}(i,j)\\Longleftrightarrow i\\le j,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{PReach}_{632}(i,j)\\Longleftrightarrow j\\le i.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>过去时态语义对象是三元组</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PastObj}_{632}=(\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{Pred}_{632},\\operatorname{PReach}_{632}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{PastObj}_{632}=(\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{Pred}_{632},\\operatorname{PReach}_{632}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pred}_{632}\">\\(\\operatorname{Pred}_{632}\\)</span> 解释一步过去算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PReach}_{632}\">\\(\\operatorname{PReach}_{632}\\)</span> 解释 since 构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的回溯量化域。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-满足关系\">11. 满足关系</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{632}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Trace}_{632}\\times\\mathbb Z\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Vdash_{632}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Trace}_{632}\\times\\mathbb Z\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为满足下列递归子句的最小关系。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\Vdash_{632}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\np\\in\\nu(k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\Vdash_{632}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\np\\in\\nu(k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\not\\Vdash_{632}\\bot.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\not\\Vdash_{632}\\bot.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\Vdash_{632}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,k\\not\\Vdash_{632}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\Vdash_{632}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,k\\not\\Vdash_{632}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\Vdash_{632}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,k\\not\\Vdash_{632}A\\ \\text{或}\\ \\nu,k\\Vdash_{632}B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\Vdash_{632}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,k\\not\\Vdash_{632}A\\ \\text{或}\\ \\nu,k\\Vdash_{632}B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\Vdash_{632}XA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,k+1\\Vdash_{632}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\Vdash_{632}XA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,k+1\\Vdash_{632}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\Vdash_{632}YA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,k-1\\Vdash_{632}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\Vdash_{632}YA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,k-1\\Vdash_{632}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\Vdash_{632}A\\,U\\,B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists j\\in\\mathbb Z\\,\n\\bigl(k\\le j\\wedge\\nu,j\\Vdash_{632}B\\wedge\n\\forall h\\in\\mathbb Z\\,(k\\le h&lt;j\\to\\nu,h\\Vdash_{632}A)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\Vdash_{632}A\\,U\\,B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists j\\in\\mathbb Z\\,\n\\bigl(k\\le j\\wedge\\nu,j\\Vdash_{632}B\\wedge\n\\forall h\\in\\mathbb Z\\,(k\\le h&lt;j\\to\\nu,h\\Vdash_{632}A)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\Vdash_{632}A\\,S\\,B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists j\\in\\mathbb Z\\,\n\\bigl(j\\le k\\wedge\\nu,j\\Vdash_{632}B\\wedge\n\\forall h\\in\\mathbb Z\\,(j&lt;h\\le k\\to\\nu,h\\Vdash_{632}A)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\Vdash_{632}A\\,S\\,B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists j\\in\\mathbb Z\\,\n\\bigl(j\\le k\\wedge\\nu,j\\Vdash_{632}B\\wedge\n\\forall h\\in\\mathbb Z\\,(j&lt;h\\le k\\to\\nu,h\\Vdash_{632}A)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"12.-语义后果\">12. 语义后果</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}\\)</span>，定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{632}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{632}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Trace}_{632}\">\\(\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Trace}_{632}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\nu,k\\Vdash_{632}B\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\nu,k\\Vdash_{632}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\nu,k\\Vdash_{632}B\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\nu,k\\Vdash_{632}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Val}_{632}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}:\\varnothing\\models_{632}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Val}_{632}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{632}:\\varnothing\\models_{632}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"13.-整个形式系统\">13. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{LTLPast}_{632}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop}_{632},\\mathsf{Frm}_{632},\\operatorname{FV}_{632},\\operatorname{BV}_{632},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{632},\\widehat\\sigma_{632},\\equiv_{\\alpha,632},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{632},\\mathsf{Rule}_{632},\\mathsf{Line}_{632},\\mathsf{Proof}_{632},\\vdash_{632},\\mathsf{Thm}_{632},\n\\mathsf{Trace}_{632},\\operatorname{Succ}_{632},\\operatorname{Pred}_{632},\n\\operatorname{FReach}_{632},\\operatorname{PReach}_{632},\\mathsf{PastObj}_{632},\n\\Vdash_{632},\\models_{632},\\mathsf{Val}_{632}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{LTLPast}_{632}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop}_{632},\\mathsf{Frm}_{632},\\operatorname{FV}_{632},\\operatorname{BV}_{632},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{632},\\widehat\\sigma_{632},\\equiv_{\\alpha,632},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{632},\\mathsf{Rule}_{632},\\mathsf{Line}_{632},\\mathsf{Proof}_{632},\\vdash_{632},\\mathsf{Thm}_{632},\n\\mathsf{Trace}_{632},\\operatorname{Succ}_{632},\\operatorname{Pred}_{632},\n\\operator